---
title: "Frigate Config Builder"
description: "Generate a ready-to-use Frigate NVR configuration file. Pick your cameras, Coral TPU, and recording preferences."
layout: base.njk
tool:
  name: "Frigate Config Builder"
  description: "Build a production-ready Frigate config.yml for your security camera setup"
  icon: "📹"
  category: "Homelab"
  keywords:
    - frigate
    - nvr
    - security camera
    - coral tpu
    - home assistant
    - config generator
---

{% block toolStyles %}
<style>
  .frigate-builder {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .frigate-builder .step {
    background: var(--bg-card, #1e1e2e);
    border: 1px solid var(--border, #313244);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .frigate-builder .step h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary, #cdd6f4);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .frigate-builder .step h3 .step-num {
    background: var(--accent, #89b4fa);
    color: #1e1e2e;
